.TH "INSPEKT\-TYPE" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-type \- Type text into the currently focused element.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]type\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Type text into the currently focused element.
.PP
Simulates realistic keyboard input with configurable typing speed:
.IP \(bu 2
instant: All text at once (default for long text)
.IP \(bu 2
fast: 50ms between characters
.IP \(bu 2
normal: 100ms between characters (default)
.IP \(bu 2
slow: 200ms between characters
.PP
Each character triggers proper input events, making it work with
reactive frameworks (React, Vue, etc.)
that listen for input events rather than value changes.
.PP
The \(ensubmit flag presses Enter after typing, useful for:
.IP \(bu 2
Search boxes
.IP \(bu 2
Login forms
.IP \(bu 2
Chat inputs
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]TEXT\f[R]
required text argument
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-s\f[R], \f[B]\(enselector\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
CSS selector to focus before typing
.TP
\f[B]\(enspeed\f[R], \f[I]INTEGER\f[R]
Typing speed in characters per second (default: fastest, 0: human\-like)
.TP
\f[B]\(enclear\f[R]
Clear existing text before typing (default: true)
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt type \(aqHello, world!\(aq
inspekt type \(aqsearch query\(aq \-\-submit
inspekt type \(aqpassword123\(aq \-\-speed instant
inspekt type \(dqHello World\(dq
.EE
